# The recorded corpus is the measurement instrument: WAV files that must stay
# byte-identical, because every figure the bench publishes is read off them.
# Git LFS keeps them out of the pack while the manifest checksums keep them honest.
#
# bench/fixture-corpus is deliberately NOT tracked: those files are generated by
# bench/make-fixture-corpus.ts, they are already in history as plain blobs, and
# moving them now would rewrite it for no gain.
bench/corpus/**/*.wav filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text

# Written by `bun patch --commit`, never by hand.
patches/*.patch linguist-generated=true
